WEBVTT

00:07:57.505 --> 00:08:02.112
access to high-quality,
voluntary reproductive health care.

00:08:03.169 --> 00:08:05.775
To have children by choice
rather than chance

00:08:05.799 --> 00:08:08.068
is a matter of autonomy and dignity.

00:08:09.478 --> 00:08:12.215
Yet in the US,

00:08:12.239 --> 00:08:15.103
45 percent of pregnancies are unintended.

00:08:15.834 --> 00:08:19.212
Two hundred and fourteen million women
in lower-income countries

00:08:19.236 --> 00:08:22.559
say they want to decide whether
and when to become pregnant

00:08:22.583 --> 00:08:24.610
but aren't using contraception.

00:08:24.634 --> 00:08:26.472
Listening to women's needs,

00:08:26.496 --> 00:08:28.525
addressing those needs,

00:08:28.549 --> 00:08:30.999
advancing equity and well-being: